        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bull Riding Challenge 4 — The Rodeo Game That Goes Deeper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a true Western adventure full of action, emotion, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to ride for honor, passion, and the memory of a legend — built with heart for Texas and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bull Riding Challenge 4, you play as a young cowboy chasing greatness and the 12 golden buckles, in a narrative-driven rodeo journey designed for PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic bull riding:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard and mouse to keep your balance, react to the bull’s movement, and hold on tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Exploration:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a lively Western village on foot or on horseback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side activities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill challenges, mini-games, and meaningful encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Competition:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboards and prove your talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customization:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards and unlock new outfits, gear, and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Powerful and Emotional Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the son of a rodeo legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it’s your turn to ride, rise, and honor his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge brings you closer to facing the final, ultimate bull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to ride the ultimate bull?</p>",
